+(deftest a-render-face-is-stored-as-its-effective-function
+  ;; CLASS: the lift stored a schema row's ROOT properties only, as EDN
+  ;; strings: a pair declared on an :and arm or inherited through a reference
+  ;; was absent from its row, and no face was a ref the writer could check.
+  ;; Each face is now the nearest declaration along Malli's reference chain,
+  ;; stored as a ref to its function by identity.
